        <mxCell id="tIAxWrpB7dYUYRDo8Sug-5" value="&lt;b&gt;Update Triggers:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-end=&quot;75&quot; data-start=&quot;60&quot;&gt;Device Boot:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Every time the device starts up, it automatically requests an update (refresh).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; data-start=&quot;163&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;24-Hour Interval:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If the device remains powered on, it will check for updates every 24 hours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-end=&quot;287&quot; data-start=&quot;267&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Appstore Trigger:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;When a change is made to the installation state of an app in the Appstore (e.g., an app is installed, updated, or removed), affected devices receive an immediate update request. This happens through an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot; data-start=&quot;492&quot;&gt;RPC call&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; from the Appstore to the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;544&quot; data-start=&quot;530&quot;&gt;m2cp-gateway&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;, which then triggers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot; data-end=&quot;573&quot; data-start=&quot;566&quot;&gt;snapd&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; to refresh.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="40" width="670" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tIAxWrpB7dYUYRDo8Sug-20" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.95;exitY=0.86;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="tIAxWrpB7dYUYRDo8Sug-6" target="tIAxWrpB7dYUYRDo8Sug-19" edge="1">
